          \u0432\u044B\u0434\u0430\u0439 \u0441\u043F\u0435\u0448\u043A\u0438."
        textEn: "In exactly three weeks. The Order will hoard its power until the
          final night. Prepare slowly but surely \u2014 and don't betray any haste."
        triggerSpeech: 1
